Provenance / fork lineage
-------------------------
This repository (xbohe/wa2-godot-ios) is an iOS adaptation of WA2 Godot. Its
initial iOS port was created by Gdadfk in the fork Gdadfk/wa2-godot-ios
(commit "5c393ba Initial iOS port"), which itself forked dorakyuraduang/wa2-godot
(the Android upstream). Attribution for the underlying Godot engine reimplementation
is retained to dorakyuraduang/wa2-godot and its contributors; attribution for the
original iOS bring-up is retained to Gdadfk.

